        "original_id": "7a1802a7-6789-5e93-b0e4-21d57dc49f53",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dan Balan, T.I., Rihanna, Radu Sîrbu, Arsenie Todiraș\n- Music groups: O-Zone\n- Songs: \"Live Your Life\"\n- Albums: \"Paper Trail\"\n\nFacts:\n- O-Zone was a Moldovan pop music trio active from 1998 to 2005, and it consisted of Dan Balan, Radu Sîrbu, and Arsenie Todiraș.\n- \"Live Your Life\" is a song by American rapper T.I. from his 2008 sixth studio album \"Paper Trail\" and features Barbadian singer Rihanna.\n- Dan Balan was the first and only Moldovan musician to be nominated for a Grammy as a co-writer of Rihanna and T.I.'s \"Live Your Life\".",
